          "href"
        ]
      },
      "synchronous": false
    },
    "colour": {
      "description": "From OScope's colour target, centred in the field of the 5× or the\n10×: its 24 patches measured through the active geometry, the dark\nand the flat field taken out, white-balanced on its lightest grey,\nand the colour matrix fitted. Refused if the colours fit poorly.\n\nA job on the instrument: its result is the set, `calibration/<id>`.",
      "title": "Calibrates colour.",
      "forms": [
        {
          "href": "/api/v1/calibration/colour",
          "op": [
            "invokeaction"
