    "flat": {
      "description": "At a blank part of the slide, through the fitted objective, in the\nlights that are on: `frames` frames averaged (16), the dark taken\naway, each colour scaled to a mean of 1; with the white balance the\nblank field gives. Refused if the field isn't blank.\n\nA job on the instrument: its result is the set, `calibration/<id>`.",
      "title": "Takes a flat field.",
      "forms": [
        {
          "href": "/api/v1/calibration/flat",
